      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "paragraph_index": 1,
          "dominant_move": "The summary opens on a duty rather than a method: stability, sustainability and environmental integrity must be ensured ",
          "language_unit_ids": [
            "LU-E-2025-2515136-001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph_index": 2,
          "dominant_move": "The first task is solved by naming three borrowed theories in one sentence, Petri nets, Lotka-Volterra and energy flow, ",
          "language_unit_ids": [
            "LU-E-2025-2515136-002"
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph_index": 3,
          "dominant_move": "The solver is named twice and misspelled once, the Longe-Kuta algorithm and the discrete dynamic simulation algorithm, s",
          "language_unit_ids": [
            "LU-E-2025-2515136-003"
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph_index": 4,
          "dominant_move": "The maturity result is given as a shift with both endpoints: the index moves from 9.35 to 11.33 after the species return",
          "language_unit_ids": [
            "LU-E-2025-2515136-004"
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph_index": 5,
          "dominant_move": "The collapse condition is stated as an inequality the reader can test: when the ratio of the two competition coefficient",
          "language_unit_ids": [
            "LU-E-2025-2515136-005"
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph_index": 6,
          "dominant_move": "The comparison of the two returning species is ranked in one clause: bats help the stability substantially, woodpeckers ",
          "language_unit_ids": [
            "LU-E-2025-2515136-006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph_index": 7,
          "dominant_move": "The fuzzy evaluation closes the summary with three decimals, 0.5462, 0.7445 and 0.2458, and then translates them into a ",
          "language_unit_ids": [
            "LU-E-2025-2515136-007"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
